usage: run_resources.py [-h] --repo REPO --builder-output BUILDER_OUTPUT
                        --reference REFERENCE --probe PROBE --output OUTPUT
                        --expected-build-sha256 EXPECTED_BUILD_SHA256
                        [--prepare-only]

Admit a fresh fixed 07b portable build, then invoke the three unchanged
resource recipes.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --repo REPO
  --builder-output BUILDER_OUTPUT
  --reference REFERENCE
  --probe PROBE
  --output OUTPUT
  --expected-build-sha256 EXPECTED_BUILD_SHA256
  --prepare-only        Admit the already fresh build and run only the frozen
                        driver input checks.
